                    the Department of Defense, are not printed. (S/S–NSC Files, Lot 63 D 351, NSC 114
                    Series)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d59-f3" n="3" xml:id="d59-f3-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg229">p. 229</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d59-f4" n="4" xml:id="d59-f4-content">
                <p>See footnote 1, <ref target="#pg230">p. 230</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
